data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":88,"item_id":"rs_065bf45199317461016acd1fed8b4081979be5de1ce1361726","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering test structure**\n\nI’m thinking about how to add a new file for tests. I could duplicate a helper or an existing test, or maybe edit the unique beginnings. It seems I need to use the existing test and insert something before the first test for clarity. I want to aim for a comprehensive structure of about 100 lines, so I’ll have to ensure everything flows well together. It’s all about making it as organized as possible!"}

